      "writtenOn": "2026-06-26T07:15:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah I see. If it\u0027s a pointer I wonder why we have `kNoConfig` and don\u0027t just use `nullptr`. I guess it\u0027s slightly more self-explanatory. Anyway no change needed.",
